                        "entry_id": "18fb44c0-ba8f-357f-b1e2-918266588246",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Small circle-shaped sequins of precious metal sewn to clothing for decorative effect, popular in the 17th century."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
